Reported-by: Michal Toman <michal.toman@imgtec.com>
Fixes: bf82cb30c7e5 ("MIPS: Save MSA extended context around signals")
Tested-by: Aaro Koskinen <aaro.koskinen@iki.fi>
Cc: James Hogan <james.hogan@imgtec.com>
